@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@hotelId = {{createdHotelId}}
@serviceDate = 2026-12-01
@taskId = {{createdHousekeepingTaskId}}

### Get housekeeping plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/housekeeping/plans?hotelId={{hotelId}}&date={{serviceDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generate housekeeping plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/housekeeping/plans/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "serviceDate": "{{serviceDate}}",
  "attendantCount": 4
}

### Update housekeeping task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/housekeeping/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendantNumber": 1,
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "notes": "HTTP test update"
}
